  "schema": 1,
  "_comment": "Corrections to a season’s item tooltip where the pak’s prose has not caught up with the season’s own ruleset values — a hardcoded number the season changed, or a value the season no longer defines. Applied by parser step 08d after %placeholder% substitution, per season and language, as exact fragment replacements; a fragment that no longer matches is reported, so an entry can be retired when the pak catches up. The new numbers are the season’s own AbilityValues (equipment) or gemData (runes); nothing here is guessed.",
  "_sourceComment": "0505/0849: S3 AbilityValues add ability_stacks_per_crit 2, while the tooltip hardcodes “1 stack”. 0527/0766: the S3 AbilityValues drop ability_value_armor_bonus_max, so the “Maximum: 50” clause no longer exists. G406/G407/G410/G500/G507/G514/G518: S3 gemData rebalances the ability parameters (drow_005_swift_agi_amp_pct and its cap, drow_005_feather_damage_pct, drow_005_volley_damage_pct, void_spirit_001_puppet_damage_pct, void_spirit_001_dual_shift_damage_pct, void_spirit_009_cast_burst_max_count, void_spirit_004_flurry_multiplier) while the tooltip still prints the base numbers; G518’s percentages are 200% × the multiplier, which is why they move 200/300/400 → 300/450/600.",
